        "examTip": "The examiner grades on COMMUNICATIVE COMPETENCE (content + relevance) and LINGUISTIC COMPETENCE (grammar + vocabulary). Cover all content points asked in the question, then layer in sophisticated language. A well-structured piece with clear paragraphing always outscores a disorganised one, even with better grammar."
