        "examTip": "Prepare two model literature responses before the exam - one on theme, one on character. Memorise your key quotes and analysis points. In the exam, adapt your prepared material to the specific question asked. This is not cheating - it is smart preparation. The examiner expects prepared material delivered relevantly."
